   "id": 159724,
   "url": "https://fullpokko.com/yamagura-partner/nannamatsuri/",
   "date": "2026-07-03",
   "title": "【週末どこ行く？】入場無料＆来場特典つき！山形市で「NAGAWAなつまつり」7月11日(土)開催",
   "html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">「今週末、子どもを連れてどこに行こう…？」とお悩みのファミリーに、絶対おすすめしたい夏のおでかけ情報が飛び込んできました！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2026年7月11日（土）、山形市のナガワ山形展示場で、大人も子どもも1日中楽しめる<strong><mark style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0%,#FFB7B7 0%)\" class=\"dbp-e-marker\">「NAGAWAなつまつり」</mark></strong>が開催されます。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">大迫力の「はたらく車」の展示や、お祭り気分を味わえる縁日、絶品グルメが揃うキッチンカー、さらには新鮮野菜の直売まで、ワクワクするコンテンツが目白押し！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">しかも、これだけ充実していて<strong>【入場無料】</strong>なんです！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">「お昼ごはんも兼ねて、家族でサクッと楽しみたい！」という方にぴったりの、大満足間違いなしのイベント。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">さっそくその見どころをご紹介します♪</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">〈大型〉はたらく車に乗れるチャンス！（協賛：レンタルシステム株式会社様・羽黒建設有限会社様）</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">今回、子どもたちの視線をくぎ付けにすること間違いなしなのが「はたらく車」コーナー！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">普段は工事現場でしか見られないホイールローダーや大型バックホウが間近に登場。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">なんと、実際に乗って体験できる貴重なチャンスです。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/31136398fdd72b60ec77c6a2bd473234.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159745 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/31136398fdd72b60ec77c6a2bd473234.jpg 1200w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/31136398fdd72b60ec77c6a2bd473234-500x375.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/31136398fdd72b60ec77c6a2bd473234-680x510.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/31136398fdd72b60ec77c6a2bd473234-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">見上げるほどの大きな車体は迫力満点！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">乗り物好きのお子さんは大興奮間違いなし。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">運転席に座るかっこいい姿は絶好のシャッターチャンスなので、ぜひカメラを準備してお出かけくださいね。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"890\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/23757dcb320563a88cd4096fd0d5dbc7.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159744 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/23757dcb320563a88cd4096fd0d5dbc7.jpg 1200w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/23757dcb320563a88cd4096fd0d5dbc7-500x371.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/23757dcb320563a88cd4096fd0d5dbc7-680x504.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/23757dcb320563a88cd4096fd0d5dbc7-768x570.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">子どもが夢中になる「縁日コーナー」も無料！</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">夏まつりといえば、やっぱり縁日は外せませんよね！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">会場では、お菓子射的・スーパーボールすくい・<mark style=\"color:rgb(46 53 58);background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"dbp-e-color\">水ヨーヨー</mark>など、お祭りの定番遊びが【無料】で楽しめちゃうんです。（※お一人様一回まで）</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">子どもたちのとびきりの笑顔が見られること間違いなしのコーナーです♪</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"680\" height=\"545\" data-id=\"159751\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2b76ec4f67467453f95ad89c7ba51557-1-680x545.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159751 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2b76ec4f67467453f95ad89c7ba51557-1-680x545.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2b76ec4f67467453f95ad89c7ba51557-1-500x401.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2b76ec4f67467453f95ad89c7ba51557-1-768x616.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2b76ec4f67467453f95ad89c7ba51557-1.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1127\" height=\"1200\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bc5025b137964a479f97c6bf36f03732-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159752 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bc5025b137964a479f97c6bf36f03732-1.jpg 1127w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bc5025b137964a479f97c6bf36f03732-1-470x500.jpg 470w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bc5025b137964a479f97c6bf36f03732-1-680x724.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bc5025b137964a479f97c6bf36f03732-1-768x818.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1127px) 100vw, 1127px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">採れたて“野菜大売出し”（出店：有限会社マエダ様 農産事業部）</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">村山市で人気の産直「JIDORE」を運営する有限会社マエダ（農産事業部）が、当日限定で出張販売にやってきます！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">普段は村山市楯岡の無人店舗でしか買えない新鮮な野菜が山形市で手に入ります。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1174\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159750 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-1.jpg 1200w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-1-500x489.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-1-680x665.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-1-768x751.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">当日は、きゅうり、なす、トウモロコシ、トマトなど、夏バテ防止にぴったりの旬の野菜がズラリと並ぶ予定です。<br><span style=\"font-size:.8em\" class=\"dbp-e-font-size\">※野菜・価格・品ぞろえは当日の仕入れ状況によって異なります。</span></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"680\" height=\"510\" data-id=\"159756\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/3f84fe00ffef014c90d1385999a162d6-1-680x510.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159756 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/3f84fe00ffef014c90d1385999a162d6-1-680x510.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/3f84fe00ffef014c90d1385999a162d6-1-500x375.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/3f84fe00ffef014c90d1385999a162d6-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/3f84fe00ffef014c90d1385999a162d6-1.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"680\" height=\"510\" data-id=\"159757\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/dd7f780e7fe77ef033960cb0ecdc7c3f-1-680x510.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159757 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/dd7f780e7fe77ef033960cb0ecdc7c3f-1-680x510.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/dd7f780e7fe77ef033960cb0ecdc7c3f-1-500x375.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/dd7f780e7fe77ef033960cb0ecdc7c3f-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/dd7f780e7fe77ef033960cb0ecdc7c3f-1.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">絶品グルメが勢ぞろい！おいしいキッチンカーが大集合</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">お腹が空いたらキッチンカーへGO！会場には、行列必至の人気キッチンカーが3台登場します。</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/yamaga_gelato/\">yamaga gelato</a>（ヤマガジェラート）</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">夏の暑さを吹き飛ばす、ひんやり冷たいジェラートはいかが？</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">山形県産のフルーツをふんだんに使用した、パティシエ特製の本格フランス仕立てジェラート。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">一口食べればリッチな果実感が口いっぱいに広がります。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1082\" height=\"654\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/b78822e06fe9301498ef80ff32d76799.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159758 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/b78822e06fe9301498ef80ff32d76799.png 1082w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/b78822e06fe9301498ef80ff32d76799-500x302.png 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/b78822e06fe9301498ef80ff32d76799-680x411.png 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/b78822e06fe9301498ef80ff32d76799-768x464.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1082px) 100vw, 1082px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/berry.s_kitchen/\">Berry's Kitchen</a>（ベリーズキッチン）</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">がっつりお食事からスイーツまで、家族の「食べたい！」にすべて応えてくれる万能キッチンカー！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">食べ応え抜群のジューシーな肉巻きおにぎりや、外はサクッ・中はもちもちのチュロスなど、お祭り気分を盛り上げるメニューが揃っています。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"680\" height=\"680\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/d24ef3d07f77f1fd9418aa9a994354a2-680x680.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159736 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/d24ef3d07f77f1fd9418aa9a994354a2-680x680.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/d24ef3d07f77f1fd9418aa9a994354a2-500x500.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/d24ef3d07f77f1fd9418aa9a994354a2-300x300.jpg 300w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/d24ef3d07f77f1fd9418aa9a994354a2-768x768.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/d24ef3d07f77f1fd9418aa9a994354a2.jpg 1080w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/aishinkakura1962/\">武蔵屋</a>（むさしや）</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">食欲をそそる香ばしい匂いがたまらない！なつまつりの定番といえば、やっぱり焼き鳥。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">一本一本丁寧に焼き上げられた熱々の焼き鳥は、小腹が空いたときのおやつにも、おつまみにも最高です。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"680\" height=\"680\" data-id=\"159735\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-680x680.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159735 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-680x680.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-500x500.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-300x300.jpg 300w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b-768x768.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/28a6140634dde03f73babb93d911d17b.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"680\" height=\"728\" data-id=\"159734\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_8363-680x728.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159734 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_8363-680x728.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_8363-467x500.jpg 467w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_8363-768x823.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_8363.jpg 1179w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">もらえる！うれしい「来場プレゼント」</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">無料で遊べるだけでなく、なんとご来場いただいた方（各ご家庭1組様）に、<strong><mark style=\"color:rgb(46 53 58);background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"dbp-e-color\">日用品</mark>（数量限定）を1個無料でプレゼント！</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><mark style=\"color:rgb(46 53 58);background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"dbp-e-color\">また野菜直販で野菜をご購入いただいた方に焼き鳥2本プレゼント！（各ご家庭1セットまで、また数量限定）</mark></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"680\" height=\"495\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/378955-680x495.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-160064 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/378955-680x495.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/378955-500x364.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/378955-768x559.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/378955-1536x1117.jpg 1536w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/378955.jpg 1958w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">必見！「創立60周年記念セール」も同時開催中</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">さらに、株式会社ナガワは今年で記念すべき創立60周年を迎えます。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">日頃の感謝を込めて、<strong>7月31日まで「創立60周年記念セール」</strong>を同時開催中！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1241\" height=\"1755\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/396943d74e3e0f9a208fc24c45ce48f3.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159733 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/396943d74e3e0f9a208fc24c45ce48f3.jpg 1241w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/396943d74e3e0f9a208fc24c45ce48f3-354x500.jpg 354w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/396943d74e3e0f9a208fc24c45ce48f3-680x962.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/396943d74e3e0f9a208fc24c45ce48f3-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/396943d74e3e0f9a208fc24c45ce48f3-1086x1536.jpg 1086w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1241px) 100vw, 1241px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">新棟ハウスからお手頃な中古ハウスまで、バリエーション豊かなユニットハウスが大集合。現品限りのお買い得商品を大放出しています。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">「物置が欲しい」「趣味の部屋を作りたい」とご検討中の方、お見積りやご見学は【無料】です。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">イベントを楽しむついでに、ぜひお気軽にご相談ください！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"toc-id-1-10\">イベント＆ナガワ山形営業所の基本情報</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"toc-id-1-11\">➀「NAGAWAなつまつり」イベント概要</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>■開催日</strong>：2026年7月11日（土）<br><strong>■時 間</strong>：10:00 ～ 16:00<br><strong>■会 場</strong>：ナガワ山形営業所（展示場）<br><strong>■住 所</strong>：〒990-2402 山形県山形市小立２丁目１−２３</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">▼所在地マップはこちら</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-dbp-map dbp-map\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9\"><iframe data-src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=%E3%83%8A%E3%82%AC%E3%83%AF%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E5%96%B6%E6%A5%AD%E6%89%80&amp;t=m&amp;z=15&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;output=embed\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" class=\"lazyload\" /></iframe></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">▼イベント当日の駐車場案内</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"680\" height=\"549\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0482cba0e392e4f16a29f6ab63f19a47-680x549.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-141693 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0482cba0e392e4f16a29f6ab63f19a47-680x549.png 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0482cba0e392e4f16a29f6ab63f19a47-500x404.png 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0482cba0e392e4f16a29f6ab63f19a47-768x620.png 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0482cba0e392e4f16a29f6ab63f19a47.png 894w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"i-8\">➁ナガワ山形営業所 基本情報</span></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>【TEL】</strong> 023-626-5880<br><strong>【営業時間】</strong> 9：00～18：00<br><strong>【定休日】</strong> 土・日・祝日・年末年始・夏季休暇（※イベント当日は特別営業いたします）</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">【事務所・展示場風景】</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/d8b25922b8b6228ec5a276b4f7b50e43.jpg\" alt=\"事務所画像\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-121519 lazyloaded\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/d8b25922b8b6228ec5a276b4f7b50e43.jpg 640w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/d8b25922b8b6228ec5a276b4f7b50e43-500x375.jpg 500w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/d8b25922b8b6228ec5a276b4f7b50e43.jpg\" srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/d8b25922b8b6228ec5a276b4f7b50e43.jpg 640w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/d8b25922b8b6228ec5a276b4f7b50e43-500x375.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608.jpg\" alt=\"モジュール画像\" width=\"641\" height=\"433\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-121520 lazyloaded\" data-srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608.jpg 2169w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-500x338.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-680x460.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-768x519.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-1536x1038.jpg 1536w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-2048x1384.jpg 2048w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px\" src=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608.jpg\" srcset=\"https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608.jpg 2169w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-500x338.jpg 500w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-680x460.jpg 680w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-768x519.jpg 768w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-1536x1038.jpg 1536w, https://fullpokko.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/01b3be5fdbca9767e1c341f15aa5d608-2048x1384.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px\" /></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center dbp-id-ac8cdbab wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>【公式ホームページ/SNS】</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-dbp-button is-align-center dbp-button\" style=\"--dbp--button--color-background:rgb(var(--rd--c--information));--dbp--button--color-text:rgb(var(--rd--c--information-on))\"><a class=\"dbp-b